WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.460
Nine people are planning a barbecue in a group chat.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.180
Saturday at two, at the park?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.680
Two of them give it a thumbs up.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.960
Then nobody posts anything for forty-one minutes.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.050
On Saturday, all nine are at the park at two.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:18.900
A doctoral thesis from the School of Emergent Priorities asks who decided that, and when.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.710
Before this, I kept committee minutes for eight years.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:28.560
For this thesis, I coded every proposal in three hundred and eighteen donated group chats.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:33.570
Of the proposals that became the plan, eighty-eight point one per cent were carried by lapse.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.170
They were never agreed to in words by a majority.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.840
They simply went unanswered.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.930
A carried proposal drew a median of two thumbs,

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.270
whether the chat had five members or twenty.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.720
Assent costs a tap,

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.000
and dissent costs a typed sentence with one's name on it.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:55.940
She then went to forty-six occasions, with the plan printed as a checklist.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.370
An item claimed by its bringer arrived ninety-three point three per cent of the time.

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:04.210
An item with no name on it, thirty-one point two.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.830
At one barbecue, the ice had five thumbs and no name.

00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:09.423
Nobody brought any.

00:01:09.723 --> 00:01:11.433
Names bring things, and thumbs do not.

00:01:13.233 --> 00:01:16.493
The School has adopted the Lapse Standard for its committees.

00:01:16.793 --> 00:01:21.723
A motion is carried on two affirming reactions and forty minutes without a typed reply,

00:01:21.923 --> 00:01:23.663
whatever the size of the committee.

00:01:25.063 --> 00:01:27.763
A proposal becomes the plan not by being agreed to,

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:29.613
but by not being answered.
